so 800 to 1,000 pounds, but more recent ones have it reaching all the way up to 1,000 kilograms

01:26:01.586 --> 01:26:08.929
or almost 200, 700 pounds, which would make it one of the biggest ruminants of all time,

01:26:09.109 --> 01:26:12.630
rivaling today's giraffes and the largest bovids that live.

