So okay, let's talk about the Himalayas.

01:27:13.085 --> 01:27:15.026
Welcome to the Himalayas.

01:27:16.927 --> 01:27:22.009
The crashing of India into Asia created the Himalayas completely.

01:27:22.069 --> 01:27:23.330
That is why they're there.

01:27:24.150 --> 01:27:32.934
And the Himalayas are a massive range of mountains, stretching some 2,400 kilometers or 1,500

01:27:33.046 --> 01:27:38.649
miles between the Indian and Tibetan, the Indian subcontinent and the Tibetan Plateau.

01:27:39.129 --> 01:27:42.211
They cross five different countries.

01:27:44.412 --> 01:27:48.093
And over 52 million people live among the Himalayan mountains.

01:27:48.634 --> 01:27:51.335
These are the world's highest peaks.

01:27:51.695 --> 01:27:56.758
They hold many of the highest peaks and the highest peak.

01:27:56.978 --> 01:27:57.498
Mount Everest.

01:27:58.865 --> 01:27:59.785
Mount Everest.

01:27:59.825 --> 01:28:00.345
29,029 feet.

